  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fbf5dfea2f462d85c3662fb70649d271095480e4?download\" data-file-name=\"주기율표 직소퍼즐.hwp\" data-file-size=\"96256\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D454%26fileid%3D16%26regdt%3D20210309125810&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ffbf5dfea2f462d85c3662fb70649d271095480e4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">주기율표 직소퍼즐</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">94.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec28c2f3689f982f496d8c3b01a791152688540d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec28c2f3689f982f496d8c3b01a791152688540d\" data-orgin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&lt;학기초 과학노트 만드는 방법&gt;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. pp제본표지</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"http://shopping.interpark.com/product/productInfo.do?prdNo=209839031&amp;dispNo=008001\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">http://shopping.interpark.com/product/productInfo.do?prdNo=209839031&amp;dispNo=008001</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"코라미 제본표지 73종 PP/PVC/종이표지 제본기소모품 - 인터파크\" data-og-description=\"추가 회원 중복 할인 쿠폰, 코팅/재단/제본에 대한 상품입니다.\" data-og-host=\"shopping.interpark.com\" data-og-source-url=\"http://shopping.interpark.com/product/productInfo.do?prdNo=209839031&amp;dispNo=008001\" data-og-url=\"http://shopping.interpark.com/product/productInfo.do?prdNo=209839031\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b7w1hO/hyJvLygrXJ/3o5R8nflTAy0l0TEF16GiK/img.jpg?width=300&amp;height=300&amp;face=0_0_300_300,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/yAfPr/hyJvP8u1sl/unsIMpsY8n2hAr7HZqYknk/img.jpg?width=357&amp;height=358&amp;face=47_0_238_191\"><a href=\"http://shopping.interpark.com/product/productInfo.do?prdNo=209839031&amp;dispNo=008001\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"http://shopping.interpark.com/product/productInfo.do?prdNo=209839031&amp;dispNo=008001\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b7w1hO/hyJvLygrXJ/3o5R8nflTAy0l0TEF16GiK/img.jpg?width=300&amp;height=300&amp;face=0_0_300_300,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/yAfPr/hyJvP8u1sl/unsIMpsY8n2hAr7HZqYknk/img.jpg?width=357&amp;height=358&amp;face=47_0_238_191)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">코라미 제본표지 73종 PP/PVC/종이표지 제본기소모품 - 인터파크</p><p class=\"og-desc\">추가 회원 중복 할인 쿠폰, 코팅/재단/제본에 대한 상품입니다.</p><p class=\"og-host\">shopping.interpark.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. 플라스팅카드링 (중)으로 사면 사이즈가 괜찮았어요^^</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">http://shopping.interpark.com/product/productInfo.do?prdNo=630281734&amp;dispNo=008001</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3. 화신3공펀치(고정형)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이렇게 사시면 노트 만드실 수 있어요~</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">안녕하세요. 재과만에서 도움 많이 받고 있는 교사입니다.<br>전 매년 과학 첫시간에 노트 만들기를 합니다. <br>채점기준도 정해서 포트폴리오평가에 함께 넣고 있어요^^<br>올해는 과학적 요소가 2가지 이상들어가고, 작품설명5줄이상, 색깔5가지 이상으로 넣어 채점을 했습니다. 모두 만족한 학생들에겐 도장을 찍어줘요. <br>매시간 학습지를 펀치로 뚫어주고 나눠주면 학생들이 끼우고 필기후 정리합니다. 학습지 잃어버릴 염려도 없고, 노트 쓰는것 보다 훨씬 좋더라구요^^<br>올해는 재과만에서 얻은 자료로 주기율표 스티커판도 함께 만들어 아이들이 모둠, 반전체로 잘했을 때 마다 스티커를 하나씩 제공합니다. 흑백 스티커판이 컬러 스티커판으로 바뀔때마다 아이들이 참 좋아해서 뿌듯합니다. <br>아이들 작품 첨부합니다*^^*</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0099d176ad0fe483c2b6ef5ed7f2fbd6f569c2e4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0099d176ad0fe483c2b6ef5ed7f2fbd6f569c2e4\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7b395485f476a79d15a8de000fdf83f12b7bc8f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a7b395485f476a79d15a8de000fdf83f12b7bc8f\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/69386474e60dbc8f9fc7c177a47d7bf6484cabac\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/69386474e60dbc8f9fc7c177a47d7bf6484cabac\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/25a1882fa7b9176b019fc7b14ab38ee0f35ac3f0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/25a1882fa7b9176b019fc7b14ab38ee0f35ac3f0\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba2d68234327fbe0f3915f804e38494208193348\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ba2d68234327fbe0f3915f804e38494208193348\" data-orgin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f77d40fd5b54e331bc93a3cc9cf7e9fd02fb99e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f77d40fd5b54e331bc93a3cc9cf7e9fd02fb99e\" da